<h2>STR vs long-term rental: running the numbers</h2>
<p>Short-term rentals often show higher gross revenue, but the expense list is longer. Compare the two on the same property with the same discipline:</p>
<table>
<thead><tr><th>Line item</th><th>Short-term rental</th><th>Long-term lease</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Income</td><td>Nightly rate times booked nights; varies by season and events</td><td>Monthly rent times 12, less vacancy</td></tr>
<tr><td>Taxes on income</td><td>17% HOT charged to guests and remitted</td><td>None at the rental level</td></tr>
<tr><td>Platform and management fees</td><td>Platform fees plus STR management, often a larger share of revenue</td><td>Typical leasing and management fees</td></tr>
<tr><td>Utilities, internet, supplies</td><td>Usually owner-paid</td><td>Usually tenant-paid</td></tr>
<tr><td>Cleaning and turnover</td><td>After every stay</td><td>Between tenants</td></tr>
<tr><td>Furnishing</td><td>Fully furnished and replaced over time</td><td>Usually unfurnished</td></tr>
<tr><td>Compliance</td><td>City registration, training, tax filings</td><td>Fair housing and Texas landlord rules</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p>Estimate occupancy and nightly rates from real booking data for comparable listings near the address, and stress-test a slow season. Then put both scenarios through our <a href="/tools/rental-property-calculator/">rental property calculator</a>. If the STR only wins at optimistic occupancy, the long-term lease is the safer investment.</p>

<h2>Choosing a location in Houston</h2>
<p>Demand for short-term stays in Houston tends to follow what brings visitors to town: the Texas Medical Center, downtown and its convention venues, sports and concerts, the energy corridor and the airports. Proximity to those draws helps, but so does what guests can walk to, parking and how quiet the street is. Before you buy, confirm three things for the specific property: whether it is inside Houston city limits, whether its deed restrictions allow short-term leasing, and what similar listings nearby actually book. Our guide to the <a href="/blog/best-neighborhoods-in-houston/">best neighborhoods in Houston</a> is a starting point for the areas themselves.</p>
<p>Keyless entry with unique codes per guest makes check-in smooth and lets you revoke access the moment a stay ends.</p>
